# Track only the SketchUp work; ignore the rest of the large tree.
# (2_Sales CRM and 0_Master Plan have their own repos; proposals/DXF/data are not for this repo.)
#
# NOTE: files already tracked stay tracked even when a rule below would ignore them â€”
# that is why 3_Draftsman engine files remain in the index. Ignore rules only affect
# what git would ADD, never what it already has.
/*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

# Governance for the WHOLE tree - these two must be versioned even though this repo
# otherwise tracks only 3_Draftsman. MASTER_RULES.md says which document rests where;
# CLAUDE.md is the short enforcing copy that auto-loads for every session under this tree.
!/MASTER_RULES.md
!/CLAUDE.md

# The SketchUp work now lives under its owning section folder (moved 2026-07-20 from
# the repo root). Un-ignoring a nested path requires un-ignoring each parent first.
!3_Draftsman/
3_Draftsman/*
!3_Draftsman/Sketch UP/

# within the tracked modules, skip generated/binary artifacts
**/sketchup_generator/out/
**/sketchup_study/geom_out/batch.log
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.skb
*.skp
!**/sketchup_generator/seed_template.skp   # keep the bundled seed for the orchestrator
!**/sketchup_generator/parts/*.skp         # real components placed by the generator
!**/sketchup_study/components_lib/*.skp    # the extracted real-parts library

# Local cold storage â€” archived old files, not part of the repo.
# Lowercase to match the actual folder name; the old uppercase _ARCHIVE/ rule matched
# on Windows by luck only and would have failed on a case-sensitive filesystem.
_archive/
_BACKUP/
_render/
_render_*/
_generated_drawings/

# AutoCAD session/plot logs â€” regenerated on every run, never source
Drawing1_*.log
plot.log
_tunnel.log

# The knowledge index (_brain). Keep the BUILDERS - they are the real artefact and must
# survive a machine loss. The .db itself is derived: regenerate with `node _brain/build-brain.js`,
# never commit 5 MB of index.
!/_brain/
/_brain/*
!/_brain/*.js
